  "snippet": "<footer class=\"relative mt-auto overflow-clip bg-ink-950 text-paper-0\">\n  <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-80 w-[min(900px,90vw)] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-clay-400/12 blur-3xl\"></div>\n  <div class=\"container-page relative\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 border-b border-paper-0/10 py-14 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:py-16\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow text-clay-300\">Расчёт за 15 минут</span>\n        <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[clamp(1.6rem,1.1rem+2vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold\">Нужен объём под конкретный проект?</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-paper-200/65\">Пришлём индивидуальный прайс-лист со скидкой от объёма и график отгрузок под ваш складской цикл.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:shrink-0\">\n        <a href=\"[[++site_url]]request/\" data-magnetic class=\"inline-flex h-13 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-clay-400 px-7 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink-950 hover:bg-clay-300\">Получить расчёт</a>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-call-open data-magnetic class=\"inline-flex h-13 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-paper-0/30 px-7 text-[15px] font-medium text-paper-0 hover:border-paper-0\">Заказать звонок</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8\">\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-4\">\n        <a href=\"[[++site_url]]\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80\">\n          <span class=\"text-clay-400\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/brand/logo-mark.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"rounded-md object-contain\" />\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"font-display text-[22px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em]\">Andromedda</span>\n        </a>\n        <p class=\"mt-